<title>USA: Dover Corp Q1 March 31 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Dover Corp Q1 March 31 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.70		    $0.68</p>
<p> Net			 78,500		   77,745</p>
<p> Revs		   1,008,781		  999,473</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     112,564		  113,746</p>
<p>(all data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Notes:</p>
<p>For Q1 ended March 31, 1997, Dover completed one stand-alone and three add-on acquisitions at a cost of $52 million and repurchased $33 million of its own common stock.</p>
<p>For Q1 ended March 31,1997, earnings included $9.6 million or $0.06 per share of non-recurring items, exchange gains and license fees in the Technologies segment.</p>
<p>For Q1 ended March 31, 1996, earnings in the prior year's quarter included a $2.6 million or $0.02 per share gain from the sale of a leasing business.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
